@startuml
title SplitSmart Security Trust Boundaries (proposed)
left to right direction
actor User
rectangle "Untrusted client boundary" {
 component "Swing / Web / Android / iOS UI" as Client
}
rectangle "Authenticated service boundary" {
 component "Session validation" as Session
 component "Server-side authorization\n(group + resource + role)" as Authz
 component "Domain/application rules" as Domain
}
rectangle "Protected data boundary" {
 database "Transactional records\nand audit history" as DB
 storage "Private receipt objects" as Files
 component "Outbox / notification adapter" as Outbox
}
cloud "Identity and recovery\nprovider (unselected)" as Identity
cloud "Email / push channel\n(unselected)" as Channel
User --> Client
Client --> Session : encrypted service request
Session --> Identity : verify / recover
Session --> Authz
Authz --> Domain : authorized command
Domain --> DB : scoped transaction
Domain --> Files : authorized receipt operation
Domain --> Outbox : post-commit intent
Outbox --> Channel : minimal sensitive content
note bottom of Authz
Never trust client-supplied user/group scope;
deny cross-account and cross-group access.
end note
@enduml
